
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Outlook as Outlook Client
    participant Taskpane as Add-in (Taskpane)
    participant Odoo as Odoo Server (Backend)

    User->>Outlook: Opens Email
    Outlook->>Taskpane: Activates Add-in (ItemChanged Event)
    Taskpane->>Taskpane: loadEmailContacts()
    Taskpane->>Outlook: Get Sender & Recipients
    Taskpane->>Odoo: POST /mail_plugin/partner/search (emails)
    Odoo-->>Taskpane: Returns Partner Data (Leads, Tickets, Companies)
    
    alt Partner Found
        Taskpane->>User: Displays Contact Info (PartnerView)
    else Partner Not Found
        Taskpane->>User: Displays "No Contact Found" (SearchRecords)
        User->>Taskpane: Clicks "Create Contact"
        Taskpane->>Odoo: POST /mail_plugin/partner/create
    end

    User->>Taskpane: Clicks "Log Email"
    Taskpane->>Odoo: POST /mail_plugin/log_email (message_id, body)
    Odoo-->>Taskpane: Success (Email Logged on Partner/Lead)

    Note over Odoo, Taskpane: To implement "First Quotation Sent"
    Note over Odoo: 1. Add 'first_quotation_sent_at' field to Sale Order
    Note over Odoo: 2. Override 'action_quotation_send' to set timestamp
    Note over Taskpane: 3. Update Partner.ts to fetch this field from API
